WEBVTT

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:12.420
<i>There's nothing I can do.</i>

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:16.490
There's nothing I can do.

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:16.490
<i>But I'm also incapable 
of not doing something.</i>

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:16.490
But I'm also incapable 
of not doing something.

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:20.490
<b>Hang in There,
 Higuchi-san!</b>

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:20.490
<b>Episode 19</b>

00:00:21.140 --> 00:00:24.080
All right, let's make it 
another productive day!

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:25.110
Woo!

00:00:25.110 --> 00:00:26.680
Right, Senpai?

00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:34.680
I mean...

00:00:34.680 --> 00:00:36.440
You have a really bad fever.

00:00:42.350 --> 00:00:44.040
This is serious.

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:45.260
Is it the flu?

00:00:45.620 --> 00:00:46.650
No.

00:00:46.650 --> 00:00:49.990
I've never had the flu 
since the day I was born

00:00:49.990 --> 00:00:51.940
and I never will.

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:53.890
You say that with suspicious certainty.

00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:57.410
<b>My brother 
hates that
 he's so sickly.</b>

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:00.660
<b>He never 
admits it 
when he
 has the flu.</b>

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:06.720
The spices from the curry I had for lunch 
are thrashing about in my stomach.

00:01:06.720 --> 00:01:09.160
You're right! He's blaming spices.

00:01:09.560 --> 00:01:10.910
Senpai...

00:01:11.210 --> 00:01:13.030
I don't need your aid.

00:01:13.030 --> 00:01:14.590
Don't mind me.

00:01:14.590 --> 00:01:16.370
Carry out your duties.

00:01:16.370 --> 00:01:17.680
Leave me.

00:01:17.680 --> 00:01:20.220
I can't do that!

00:01:23.080 --> 00:01:25.680
I hate to interrupt your dramatic scene,

00:01:25.680 --> 00:01:29.550
but would you mind acquiring
 some drinks to help him stay hydrated?

00:01:29.850 --> 00:01:33.690
This is a dangerous situation for anyone.

00:01:34.540 --> 00:01:36.320
Right, I'll go buy something!

00:01:36.320 --> 00:01:43.330
<b>Yogurt 
Drink</b>

00:01:36.320 --> 00:01:43.330
<b>10 billion
 lactobacillus 
cells!</b>

00:01:36.320 --> 00:01:43.330
<b>Too rich
 for you!</b>

00:01:36.840 --> 00:01:38.020
I bought a drink!

00:01:38.020 --> 00:01:39.340
Why would you buy that?!

00:01:39.340 --> 00:01:41.050
He needs <i>hydration</i>!

00:01:41.050 --> 00:01:43.320
How is he supposed to down 
something that thick?!

00:01:43.560 --> 00:01:46.950
I-I was just worried about Senpai...

00:01:46.950 --> 00:01:48.840
I was just Senpai'd about worry...

00:01:48.840 --> 00:01:52.200
I wanted the bugs in Senpai's 
stomach to be happy and well.

00:01:52.200 --> 00:01:54.620
You're supposed to help <i>him</i>,
 not just his beneficial bacteria!

00:01:54.620 --> 00:01:56.340
You aren't making any sense!

00:01:56.340 --> 00:01:59.470
<b>Dazai-kun</b>

00:01:57.450 --> 00:01:59.460
Oh, pardon me...

00:02:00.180 --> 00:02:01.520
Dazai-kun.

00:02:01.520 --> 00:02:02.660
I don't hear from you often.

00:02:03.950 --> 00:02:05.970
Ah, all right.

00:02:07.050 --> 00:02:09.440
Dazai-kun is coming to pay you a visit.

00:02:09.820 --> 00:02:10.930
Sheesh.

00:02:10.930 --> 00:02:13.230
That man sees through everything.

00:02:13.230 --> 00:02:16.220
<i>Dazai-san is coming to visit me!</i>

00:02:16.600 --> 00:02:18.390
Jeez, you scared me!

00:02:18.390 --> 00:02:19.620
What's gotten into you?

00:02:20.530 --> 00:02:21.670
<i>I'm so happy.</i>

00:02:21.990 --> 00:02:22.820
<i>But...</i>

00:02:22.820 --> 00:02:25.980
<i>I don't want to disappoint him by letting 
him see me in this frail state.</i>

00:02:25.980 --> 00:02:27.130
Are you listening?

00:02:27.440 --> 00:02:29.340
<i>I should pretend to be well.</i>

00:02:29.340 --> 00:02:31.740
<i>No, then he won't come to visit me.</i>

00:02:32.010 --> 00:02:33.390
<i>What do I do?</i>

00:02:33.380 --> 00:02:38.380
<b>Clank</b>

00:02:34.470 --> 00:02:36.050
He froze.

00:02:35.880 --> 00:02:38.380
<b>My brother
 is sensitive.</b>

00:02:38.380 --> 00:02:40.110
Whew...

00:02:38.380 --> 00:02:40.380
<b>Some
 time
 later</b>

00:02:41.390 --> 00:02:43.390
<b>He decides to let 
Dazai pay a visit</b>

00:02:44.940 --> 00:02:46.140
Oh, he's here.

00:02:46.390 --> 00:02:48.380
Dazai-san! I...

00:02:48.730 --> 00:02:51.200
Oh... Err, yeah.

00:02:51.620 --> 00:02:53.400
I came for Dazai.

00:02:53.750 --> 00:02:56.930
Nakajima Atsushi! You son of...

00:02:56.930 --> 00:02:59.410
<i>Wow, he's raging at me with my full name.</i>

00:02:59.410 --> 00:03:00.900
Rashoumon with despair!

00:03:04.170 --> 00:03:05.200
Akutagawa!

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:06.120
Senpai!

00:03:06.420 --> 00:03:07.910
Nyan, nyan!

00:03:07.910 --> 00:03:08.970
Oh, dear.

00:03:08.970 --> 00:03:12.460
I only had Atsushi-kun come first 
because I was running late.

00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:14.670
You should have let me finish.

00:03:17.670 --> 00:03:20.420
<b>Yogurt 
Drink</b>

00:03:17.670 --> 00:03:20.420
<b>10 billion
 lactobacillus
 cells!</b>

00:03:18.030 --> 00:03:19.190
Here, for your health.

00:03:19.190 --> 00:03:20.410
You, too?!

00:03:20.410 --> 00:03:22.870
He has a high fever.

00:03:22.870 --> 00:03:24.420
Are you sure he isn't going to 
have trouble drinking all this?

00:03:25.320 --> 00:03:26.200
And he did.

00:03:27.280 --> 00:03:31.330
<i>Akutagawa downed tens of billions 
of lactobacillus cells.</i>

00:03:31.920 --> 00:03:35.980
<i>His flu subsided and his 
gut flora flourished.</i>

00:03:36.590 --> 00:03:39.430
He drank mine, too!

00:03:40.050 --> 00:03:44.450
I want to give his gut bacteria 
even more of a boost.

00:03:42.490 --> 00:03:44.450
<b>We don't condone
 buying out entire
 shelves.</b>

00:03:44.450 --> 00:03:48.450
<b>Episode 20</b>

00:03:44.450 --> 00:03:48.450
<b>And the Tracks 
Go On and On</b>

00:03:49.640 --> 00:03:52.470
<i>It takes all sorts of people 
to make the world work.</i>

00:03:52.470 --> 00:03:55.300
The weather's so nice today.

00:03:55.270 --> 00:03:56.940
<b>Those who get played</b>

00:03:57.620 --> 00:03:59.670
Huh? Who's that over there?

00:04:00.080 --> 00:04:01.260
<i>Dazai-san.</i>

00:04:01.260 --> 00:04:02.970
<i>What's he doing?</i>

00:04:03.320 --> 00:04:06.940
It appears you want to learn 
of my power the hard way.

00:04:06.940 --> 00:04:09.660
<i>Seriously, what the hell is that guy doing?!</i>

00:04:09.220 --> 00:04:10.470
<b>Those who play them</b>

00:04:10.780 --> 00:04:14.130
I know you've been hiding this whole time.

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:16.590
A surprise attack?

00:04:16.590 --> 00:04:19.350
Do you really think you've 
figured out my weakness?

00:04:19.350 --> 00:04:21.730
<i>Is his enemy here, too?</i>

00:04:22.130 --> 00:04:23.960
<i>I should watch for a while.</i>

00:04:25.680 --> 00:04:27.250
Those pointy ears!

00:04:27.250 --> 00:04:28.990
The fluffy tail!

00:04:28.990 --> 00:04:31.640
Cease your resistance and come out, dog!

00:04:39.600 --> 00:04:41.050
Carl!

00:04:41.050 --> 00:04:42.840
There you are!

00:04:43.530 --> 00:04:45.540
I was so worried!

00:04:45.540 --> 00:04:47.660
Please don't leave me!

00:04:47.660 --> 00:04:51.450
I-I mean, please don't vanish like that!

00:04:51.450 --> 00:04:53.100
There, there...

00:04:53.100 --> 00:04:55.550
Now, let's hurry back to Rampo-kun.

00:04:55.550 --> 00:04:59.360
Today's the day he finally tells me
 what he thinks of my novel!

00:05:01.210 --> 00:05:07.730
I-I mean, dogs and raccoons 
are both carnivorous mammals.

00:05:07.730 --> 00:05:10.180
And some people keep raccoons as pets.

00:05:10.180 --> 00:05:14.210
Dogs and raccoons are both 
fluffy and have four legs.

00:05:14.210 --> 00:05:15.990
They both have noses and 
mouths underneath. Yup.

00:05:16.190 --> 00:05:17.960
<i>Th-This is miserable.</i>

00:05:17.960 --> 00:05:20.630
<i>I can't go out now.</i>

00:05:21.050 --> 00:05:23.100
I'm tired of making these excuses.

00:05:23.100 --> 00:05:26.470
I wish I could go back to the 
Agency with Atsushi-kun already.

00:05:26.470 --> 00:05:27.250
<i>Exactly!</i>

00:05:27.250 --> 00:05:29.270
<i>Stop listening to his excuses and go!</i>

00:05:30.520 --> 00:05:33.520
Dazai-san, you noticed me?

00:05:33.840 --> 00:05:34.890
Of course.

00:05:35.190 --> 00:05:36.200
Oh, come on.

00:05:36.200 --> 00:05:38.520
You could have said so.

00:05:38.520 --> 00:05:41.140
That whole thing about the 
dog was a joke, right?

00:05:41.140 --> 00:05:42.110
I totally thought...

00:05:42.110 --> 00:05:43.600
Of course it was.

00:05:43.600 --> 00:05:47.520
Who mistakes a raccoon for a dog?

00:05:47.830 --> 00:05:49.770
<i>Did he actually?</i>

00:05:49.770 --> 00:05:51.980
Okay, let's go back!

00:05:55.250 --> 00:05:56.420
<i>Dazai-san...</i>

00:05:56.850 --> 00:05:58.860
<i>I was here, too.</i>

00:05:59.430 --> 00:06:02.210
<i>I was here before the weretiger.</i>

00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:06.050
<i>I jumped out and called your name!</i>

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:07.800
<b>Those who aren't 
called upon</b>

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:09.690
<i>I want to say something...</i>

00:06:09.690 --> 00:06:13.180
<i>But I can't talk to him, knowing 
he's ignoring me deliberately.</i>

00:06:13.180 --> 00:06:14.810
<i>I'm such a coward!</i>

00:06:15.080 --> 00:06:17.000
Akutagawa-senpai...

00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:20.010
Are you that interested in the Agency?

00:06:19.810 --> 00:06:21.810
<b>Those whose voices
 are ignored</b>

00:06:22.030 --> 00:06:26.060
I'd attack them as soon 
as you gave me the order.

00:06:31.190 --> 00:06:34.850
What do we do about our pitiful bosses?

00:06:34.830 --> 00:06:36.080
<b>Those who take 
care of them</b>

00:06:45.090 --> 00:06:47.840
<b>Armed Detective Agency</b>

00:06:45.880 --> 00:06:47.600
Hi, we're back.

00:06:48.120 --> 00:06:50.970
Do you guys have a hobby of 
marching through the city?

00:06:50.840 --> 00:06:53.350
<b>Those who see
 through everything</b>

00:06:51.500 --> 00:06:52.230
Huh?

00:06:53.350 --> 00:06:58.350
<b>Episode 21</b>

00:06:53.350 --> 00:06:58.350
<b>Operation Body 
Double Nom Nom</b>

00:06:56.380 --> 00:06:58.350
A body double?

00:07:00.550 --> 00:07:01.420
Yeah.

00:07:01.420 --> 00:07:03.220
I'll fill you in on the details.

00:07:03.230 --> 00:07:06.730
<b>Nom
 nom 
nom</b>

00:07:04.480 --> 00:07:06.730
Stop eating already!

00:07:07.810 --> 00:07:13.250
Anyway, apparently the new deal our boss
 is about to make is really sketchy.

00:07:13.590 --> 00:07:18.240
I've been asked to find a body double
 for him among the lot of you.

00:07:18.530 --> 00:07:20.740
From among us?

00:07:20.740 --> 00:07:21.990
That's right.

00:07:21.990 --> 00:07:24.460
We can't trust an outsider

00:07:24.460 --> 00:07:27.530
and we need someone who can put up a fight.

00:07:27.790 --> 00:07:31.460
Huh, aren't you one of the 
candidates, Chuuya-san?

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:33.040
We're choosing...

00:07:33.380 --> 00:07:36.250
We're choosing someone with a 
comparable vertical profile.

00:07:36.510 --> 00:07:37.900
<i>He's trying not to say it.</i>

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:44.150
<b>First Body Double Competition</b>

00:07:38.200 --> 00:07:41.310
First Body Double Competition!

00:07:41.310 --> 00:07:42.320
Yay.

00:07:42.320 --> 00:07:43.020
Boom, boom.

00:07:43.020 --> 00:07:44.140
Bam, bam.

00:07:44.380 --> 00:07:45.220
Hey.

00:07:45.220 --> 00:07:46.330
I expect good things.

00:07:46.330 --> 00:07:47.620
Let's get this started!

00:07:47.620 --> 00:07:48.520
Boss!

00:07:48.520 --> 00:07:51.150
The boss himself is participating 
as well, of course.

00:07:51.150 --> 00:07:53.030
Keep it together, everyone!

00:07:54.560 --> 00:07:57.040
First up, Tachihara.

00:07:57.040 --> 00:07:57.980
Yes, sir.

00:08:00.500 --> 00:08:01.700
How's this?

00:08:01.910 --> 00:08:03.800
You don't have the same presence.

00:08:03.370 --> 00:08:07.420
<b>Meh</b>

00:08:04.390 --> 00:08:06.170
You have a lot to learn.

00:08:06.170 --> 00:08:07.410
I know that!

00:08:08.710 --> 00:08:13.100
You need more of a lover-of-girls vibe.

00:08:13.100 --> 00:08:15.380
You're definitely way creepier, Rintarou.

00:08:15.930 --> 00:08:17.950
That's one of the criteria, too?!

00:08:17.950 --> 00:08:19.740
All right, Higuchi, you're next.

00:08:21.600 --> 00:08:23.800
H-How do I look?

00:08:23.800 --> 00:08:25.570
Clothes make the man.

00:08:25.570 --> 00:08:27.170
I mean, she's a woman.

00:08:27.170 --> 00:08:29.200
That wasn't much different from my disguise.

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:32.450
Oh! Okay! I'll do a Boss impression!

00:08:32.750 --> 00:08:39.960
Elise-chan! Put on these clothes for me!

00:08:41.710 --> 00:08:45.660
Was that <i>really</i> so much like me?

00:08:45.660 --> 00:08:47.210
Nah, not at all.

00:08:47.210 --> 00:08:48.530
Right, Tachihara?

00:08:48.530 --> 00:08:49.460
Agreed!

00:08:49.460 --> 00:08:51.890
<i>Higuchi, I'll get you for this!</i>

00:08:51.890 --> 00:08:53.550
Okay, next...

00:08:54.760 --> 00:08:56.240
Nope. Next!

00:09:01.520 --> 00:09:03.730
<b>Whoa...</b>

00:09:03.720 --> 00:09:05.720
I like it!

00:09:05.720 --> 00:09:10.380
You're fresh, you have a presence, and you 
look just like I did when I was younger.

00:09:10.380 --> 00:09:12.130
I think they pull off the 
look better than you do.

00:09:12.130 --> 00:09:12.520
Yes!

00:09:12.930 --> 00:09:13.740
You like it?!

00:09:13.740 --> 00:09:16.710
It's true that their 
appearance is professional,

00:09:16.710 --> 00:09:20.740
but are they really capturing and 
expressing his inner qualities?

00:09:20.740 --> 00:09:23.240
Chuuya-san's talking like a critic now.

00:09:23.240 --> 00:09:24.920
I'm so defeated, I couldn't help myself.

00:09:25.390 --> 00:09:27.440
You look awesome, Senpai!

00:09:27.440 --> 00:09:30.280
Damn it, Gin! You look good in a suit.

00:09:30.280 --> 00:09:32.590
This is quite the commotion.

00:09:32.930 --> 00:09:35.270
Has a body double been chosen?

00:09:38.180 --> 00:09:42.010
I've tried putting on the clothes, 
but it seems to have been in vain.

00:09:44.730 --> 00:09:46.210
You look good, Hirotsu-san.

00:09:46.210 --> 00:09:46.970
Badass.

00:09:46.970 --> 00:09:49.010
It's flawless.

00:09:49.700 --> 00:09:51.900
He has just the right silhouette, too.

00:09:51.900 --> 00:09:53.710
Shall we have him be the body double?

00:09:53.710 --> 00:09:55.140
He's so handsome!

00:09:55.610 --> 00:09:56.770
So handsome!

00:09:56.770 --> 00:09:58.860
I like this one!

00:09:59.770 --> 00:10:01.000
Elise-chan!

00:10:02.990 --> 00:10:04.250
I don't want a body double anymore!

00:10:04.250 --> 00:10:06.020
I'll go to the meeting by myself!

00:10:07.820 --> 00:10:09.400
<i>I knew it.</i>

00:10:30.620 --> 00:10:34.490
Rampo-kun! I beg you to 
read my new mystery novel!

00:10:34.490 --> 00:10:36.090
Oh, fine.

00:10:36.090 --> 00:10:38.120
Okay, take out your manuscript—

00:10:38.120 --> 00:10:39.430
You're going to read it?!

00:10:39.430 --> 00:10:42.290
And give me the snack in your back pocket.

00:10:42.730 --> 00:10:45.570
You don't need to guess 
what's inside my pockets.
